[00:00.36] Look at me
[00:05.04] I'm as helpless as a kitten up a tree
[00:11.69] And I feel like I'm clinging to a cloud
[00:16.19] I can't understand
[00:19.73] I get misty just holding your hand (just holding your hand)
[00:29.30] Walk my way
[00:34.56] And a thousand violins begin to play
[00:40.89] Or it might be the sound of your hello
[00:45.57] That music I hear
